id: SAVE19-15
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: history_limit
target: crates/core/src/history_limit.rs
find:     len <= MAX_HISTORY_OPS
replace:     len < MAX_HISTORY_OPS
expect-fail: ops_boundary_at_and_over_limit
expect-fail: save_gate_agrees_with_load_gate
expect-fail: property_ops_boundary
note: 保存の前の件数の比較を <= から < にする（上限ちょうどの保存を断つ）
